<!DOCTYPE html>
w
<html lang="en">

<head>

    ```
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Netflix</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap"
          rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">

    <style>

            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            }

            body {
                background: #000;
                color: #fff;
            }

            header {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 20px 8%;
                background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
                position: fixed;
                width: 100%;
                top: 0;
                z-index: 1000;
            }

            .logo {
                font-size: 38px;
                font-weight: bold;
                color: #e50914;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
            }

            nav a {
                color: #fff;
                text-decoration: none;
                margin-left: 25px;
                transition: 0.3s;
            }

                nav a:hover {
                    color: #e50914;
                }

            .hero {
                height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 20px;
                background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.7), rgba(0,0,0,.9)), url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?w=1600");
                background-size: cover;
                background-position: center;
            }

                .hero h1 {
                    font-size: 60px;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                }

                .hero p {
                    font-size: 22px;
                    margin-bottom: 30px;
                }

            .btn {
                background: #e50914;
                padding: 15px 35px;
                color: white;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-size: 18px;
                border-radius: 5px;
                transition: 0.3s;
            }

                .btn:hover {
                    background: #b00610;
                }

            section {
                padding: 80px 8%;
            }

            .title {
                font-size: 32px;
                margin-bottom: 35px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .cards {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
                gap: 25px;
            }

            .card {
                background: #141414;
                padding: 35px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                text-align: center;
                transition: 0.4s;
            }

                .card:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-10px);
                    background: #1f1f1f;
                }

                .card i {
                    font-size: 55px;
                    color: #e50914;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                }

                .card h3 {
                    margin-bottom: 15px;
                }

            footer {
                background: #111;
                padding: 30px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .social i {
                font-size: 28px;
                margin: 15px;
                color: white;
                transition: 0.3s;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

                .social i:hover {
                    color: #e50914;
                }

            @@media (max-width: 768px) {

                header {
                    padding: 15px 5%;
                }

                nav {
                    display: none;
                }

                .hero h1 {
                    font-size: 40px;
                }

                .hero p {
                    font-size: 18px;
                }
            }

    </style>
    ```

</head>

<body>

    ```
    <header>

